# Base URL of the deployed ASP.NET Core API, e.g. https://sme-backend-lxsp.onrender.com/api
# Leave unset for local dev - code falls back to http://localhost:5298/api.
# In Vercel: Project Settings -> Environment Variables -> VITE_API_URL.
# Type the value rather than pasting it from a file: a pasted UTF-8 BOM in
# front of "https://" once broke sign-in on the deployed site. Production
# builds also work with it unset - vercel.json rewrites /api to the backend.
VITE_API_URL=
